%% Minting new proof-of-possession credentials
sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Workload
    participant CAA_C as CAAPI<br/>Client
    participant CAA_S as CAAPI<br/>Server
    participant CAS_C as CAS<br/>Client
    participant CAS_S as CAS<br/>Server
    participant V as Verifier
    participant CA as Certificate<br/>Authority

    autonumber

    W->>W: Generate CSK
    W->>W: Generate CSR(CSK-Pub)
    W->>W: Generate Evidence<br/>(Nonce, CSR)
    note over W, CAA_C: CAAPI Client Stub Call
    W->>CAA_C: New PoP Credential<br/>Request (Target,<br/>Credential Type,<br/>Evidence)
    note over CAA_C, CAA_S: CAAPI RPC Call
    CAA_C->>CAA_S: New PoP<br/>Credential Request
    note over CAA_S, CAS_C: CAAPI Server Stub Call
    CAA_S->>CAS_C: New PoP<br/>Credential Request
    CAS_C->>CAS_C: Select CAS Server<br/>based on Target
    note over CAS_C, CAS_S: CAS Protocol
    CAS_C->>CAS_S: Mint New PoP<br/>Credential<br/>(Evidence,<br/>Credential Type)
    note over CAS_S, V: Verifier Protocol
    CAS_S->>V: Request Attestation<br/>(Evidence)
    V->>V: Check Evidence
    V->>V: Include CSR in<br/>Attestation Results
    V-->>CAS_S: Attestation Results
    note over CAS_S, CA: CA Protocol
    CAS_S->>CA: Request Credential<br/>(Evidence,<br/>Attestation Results,<br/>Credential Type)
    CA->>CA: Validate Attestation<br/>Results incl. CSR
    CA->>CA: Mint New Credential
    CA-->>CAS_S: Newly Minted Credential
    CAS_S-->>CAS_C: Newly Minted Credential
    CAS_C-->>W: Newly Minted Credential
